Eigenvalues λ satisfy det( [a-λ, b; b, c-λ] ) = 0

So (a-λ)(c-λ) - b^2 = 0

λ^2 - (a+c)λ + (ac - b^2) = 0

a+c = 5/3 + 8/3 = 13/3

ac - b^2 = (5/3)(8/3) - (2/3)^2 = 40/9 - 4/9 = 36/9 = 4

So λ^2 - (13/3)λ + 4 = 0

Multiply by 3: 3λ^2 - 13λ + 12 = 0

Discriminant d = 169 - 144 = 25

λ = [13 ± 5]/6

